"%s updates right after WPeMatico: install the pending WPeMatico update first."
msgstr ""
"%s, WPeMatico'dan hemen sonra güncellenir: önce bekleyen WPeMatico "
"güncellemesini kurun."

#: includes/lib/update_reasons.php:116 includes/lib/update_reasons.php:123
#: includes/lib/update_reasons.php:181 includes/lib/update_reasons.php:206
